## Test Registry (Auto-Updated by Cursor)
Record verified TOTALS only — per-module counts drift and are not worth the tokens.
Never hand-count; regenerate from the suites:
 * Backend: `.venv\Scripts\python -m pytest -q`
 * Backend per-module (on demand): `.venv\Scripts\python -m pytest --collect-only -q`
 * Frontend: `cd frontend; npx vitest run`
 * Frontend types: `cd frontend; npx tsc --noEmit`

